      "content": "it's not just \"moments\" though. it's constant. it feels like the person i used to be is just... gone. and if there isn't even a real \"me\" inside here to experience things anymore, then what am i even doing? it feels like i'm just a shell going through the motions. it's exhausting to keep pretending there's someone home.",
